WEBVTT

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:11.690
Brother!

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:16.370
Here again, huh?

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:20.410
Yurikano, I promise you...

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:24.120
I will settle this war through negotiation,

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:30.300
and remind the people in the Polyhedron federation and especially Dizelmine

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:33.130
of the beauty of this ocean.

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:36.390
I pray for your success.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:41.430
I'll get going.

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:44.600
I don't get it.

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:47.480
You don't know the word "hideout"?

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:48.900
That's not what I meant!

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:53.150
I'm asking why we have to sleep in a dump like this.

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:55.990
Very soon, the bulk of the Kiss troops will rendezvous with us.

00:00:55.990 --> 00:00:58.320
When they do, my ship will be too small to support them all.

00:00:58.490 --> 00:01:00.240
Then this is all a plan to take the Voxes?

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:03.450
Easy, now! You three will stay away from the Voxes.

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:04.330
Got that?

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:07.500
I'll contact you once everything is ready.

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:10.340
Be with Kiss!

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:15.510
Be with Kiss!

