00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:52.860
Departing Katsuura, Heading to Kamogawa

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:55.570
What was that about?

00:02:55.570 --> 00:02:57.440
Do you guys do this all the time?

00:02:57.650 --> 00:02:59.900
No, it's the first time.

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:02.910
He probably made it up just now.

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:07.040
Besides, why do we even have to take orders from him?

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:09.460
That's what you get for becoming Villagiulio's lackeys.

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:11.710
I don't remember ever agreeing to that!

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:15.420
And whose lackey are you? You sure have the clothes to match.

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:17.510
I don't like this either!

00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:20.420
There was nothing else to wear! I was like this when I woke up!

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:22.930
I bet you think you look good in that.

00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:24.350
I do not!

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:29.890
Wow!

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:33.310
Look, you can see the ocean from our window!

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:35.480
What a tiny kitchen!

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:38.400
There's a closet, too.

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:41.990
Hey, we should put some blue curtains up.

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:46.990
You'll wake up in the morning feeling like you're at the bottom of the ocean!

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:52.330
Forget what I just said.

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:54.130
Huh? Yeah...

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:55.290
That's a good idea.

