00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:03.930
The Oraga Festival is one of the most crucial events for the Jersey-

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:05.390
Oraga Festival?

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:08.720
It's an arts festival!

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:12.020
All the classes and clubs get to show off their abilities!

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:14.520
Simply put, it's a school festival.

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:16.610
Oh, a school festival!

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:19.280
That explains the food booths and everything.

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:20.740
What is the Jersey Club going to do?

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:26.370
W-What?

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:37.460
Is this what we're really supposed to be doing?

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:43.010
No, no way!

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:44.430
Don't you agree?!

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:51.100
You guys...

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:53.890
Then tell me. What can we do?

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:56.190
I told you, take the Voxes and...

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:58.520
Except we all lost.

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:01.940
The three of us were undefeated back at the Academy,

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:03.030
and yet we still lost.

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:06.030
So we're supposed to just sit back and stay quiet?

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:08.570
Then we really are nothing more than Villagiulio's lackeys!

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:12.620
I'm not staying put because Villagiulio told us to.

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:14.040
Huh?

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:18.210
Izo... Tell me, just how do you plan to fight the Voxes?

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:20.250
Huh? Well, that's...

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:25.630
Our fighting style is not effective against Kyouno Madoka, Aura's pilot.

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:30.260
I've crossed swords with her, so I know.

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:34.560
I sense a mysterious strength in her.

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:36.640
Just like Yurikano.

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:39.900
Don't compare her to Yurikano!

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:44.610
But the chairman of Novumundus prohibited Kyouno Madoka from piloting.

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:47.820
That's because she's already in dangerous territory.

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:48.860
What's that supposed to mean?

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:51.780
They fear that, like Yurikano,

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:55.370
she might trigger something equivalent to the Tragedy of Militia Zodia.

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:59.580
Taking quick action isn't the only way to fight.

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:03.090
Let's pace ourselves and wait for the right time.

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:06.510
Damn it!

