00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:28.240
Nothing but odd jobs.

00:06:28.240 --> 00:06:30.030
What's wrong with that?

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:33.620
It's the Jersey Club's duty to have fun and complete the jobs we took on!

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:38.910
Madoka, you really don't mind about Midori?

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:40.620
What brought that up?

00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:42.590
No point getting stressed about it.

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:45.050
After all, she's been locked away.

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:49.300
That chairman doesn't look like the type to change her mind.

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:52.050
You should know that better than any of us.

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:53.850
Woof...

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:56.560
Say, can you pass me that green paint?{I should've made Midori->Green when I had the chance, now I look like a fool}

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:01.190
The{rokumonsen->crest}

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:01.190
Cre{rokumonsen->crest}

